# The version Montana Business for Android shows: v<MARKETING> (<build>).
#
# Montana Business keeps its own count of builds from 1, apart from the Messenger's (iOS and Android alike): the
# build number is the Business build both platforms carry, raised by the one who builds, never borrowed from the
# Messenger. The Messenger's rule of catching up with iOS 1277 does not apply here, so TARGET stays empty.
